          "seconds": 120
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the rest of the oil and 150 g thinly sliced pork belly, cut into 4 cm pieces. Fry 2 minutes, until the fat renders and the edges crisp. Season with 1/4 tsp salt and 1/4 tsp black pepper.",
      "ingredientRefs": [
        7,
        12,
        13
      ],
      "timers": [
        {
          "text": "2 minutes",
          "seconds": 120
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Add 1/2 onion, sliced and 1/2 carrot, cut into thin strips and stir-fry 1 minute, then 200 g green cabbage, cut into 3 cm pieces and stir-fry 2 minutes, until just wilted. Add 100 g bean sprouts.",
      "ingredientRefs": [
        8,
        9,
